      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for opensc fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-40510: stack buffer overflow in `piv_process_history()` allows physically present attackers to trigger memory\n  corruption by presenting a crafted PIV smart card or USB device (bsc#1266964).\n",
